  "notes": "USAGE:\nAlso used as a suru-verb: {万引|まんび}き⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to shoplift). Can also refer to the person who shoplifts ({万引|まんび}き{犯|はん} is more specific). Store signs often use the phrase {万引|まんび}き⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{犯罪|はんざい}→犯罪：03569_hanzai⟧です (shoplifting is a crime).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {万引|まんび}き⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to shoplift)\n- {万引|まんび}き{犯|はん} (shoplifter)\n- {万引|まんび}き⟦{防止|ぼうし}→防止：14571_boushi⟧ (shoplifting prevention)\n- {万引|まんび}き⟦で→で：00502_de⟧⟦{捕|つか}まる→捕まる：01959_tsukamaru⟧ (to be caught shoplifting)",
